# basePath Chapter6

::FirstContractOpenCh6
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once 

{@Player}   Hey, Blaze. How are you? How are things on Kalvis?
{@Blaze}    I'm okay. Just a little banged up. The mines are running again, but those bots are still breaking down.
{@Blaze}    Management keeps pushing us to meet production targets.
{@Player}   I guess you were right to be worried.
{@Player}	Please be REALLY careful! 
{@Blaze}	Ha! Who's the overly cautious old guy now?

// end call

{@PAL}      Here's that report you asked for on Cu-6355-29.
{@PAL}      "...minor disruption to mining operations."
{@Player}   Minor? That's not what I'm hearing!
{@PAL}      "...production has resumed and copper prices are down."



::BeforeSupplyChainCh6
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Player}   Hi, Ovill. I hear Callie's been giving you trouble.
{@Ovill}    Callie? Oh, you mean Cordelia?
{@Player}   Callie isn't her real name?
{@Ovill}    No! She started calling herself 'Callie' after Kalvis a few years ago. 
{@Ovill}	She's always been a strange one.
{@Player}   Interesting...
{@Ovill}    I'll tell you what's interesting! Frontier just opened its first fully robotic station. Very efficient!
{@Ovill}    Winkler Station... it's got a great supply of germanium.
{@Player}   Fully automated? No humans?
{@Ovill}    Nope. Just managers like us!
{@Player}   <i>Like us?</i> I'm a captain, not a manager!

// hang up

{@Player}   ...does Frontier want to make everything autonomous?


